  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb236693f9dbe47498f4dd7ccccbfbf3, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InterviewQuestionData
  question: "Delegate, Action, Func v\xE0 Event trong C# kh\xE1c nhau nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF
    n\xE0o?"
  choices:
  - text: "Action v\xE0 Func l\xE0 built-in delegate. Event d\xF9ng \u0111\u1EC3
      th\xF4ng b\xE1o gi\u1EEFa c\xE1c object, th\u01B0\u1EDDng d\xF9ng trong Observer
      pattern."
    score: 2
    feedbackHint: "Hi\u1EC3u \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c pattern nh\u01B0ng ch\u01B0a gi\u1EA3i
      th\xEDch r\xF5 technical difference."
  - text: "Delegate l\xE0 ki\u1EC3u d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u tham chi\u1EBFu \u0111\u1EBFn
      method. Action l\xE0 delegate kh\xF4ng c\xF3 return value. Func c\xF3 return
      value. Event l\xE0 wrapper c\u1EE7a delegate v\u1EDBi access modifier, ch\u1EC9
      class owner m\u1EDBi invoke \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c - b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 encapsulation."
    score: 3
    feedbackHint: "N\u1EAFm v\u1EEFng c\u1EA3 4 kh\xE1i ni\u1EC7m v\xE0 bi\u1EBFt
      khi n\xE0o d\xF9ng Event."
  - text: "T\xF4i hay d\xF9ng UnityEvent thay v\xEC m\u1EA5y c\xE1i \u0111\xF3 v\xEC
      d\u1EC5 d\xF9ng h\u01A1n."
    score: 1
    feedbackHint: "Tr\xE1nh n\xE9 c\xE2u h\u1ECFi, kh\xF4ng hi\u1EC3u core C# delegate."
  category: C#
